      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is very important to keep your staff focused strictly on observable, non-discriminatory behaviors. Trying to categorize people based on their origin or appearance is a recipe for bias and legal trouble. Instead of looking at where people are from, train your team to watch for actions like overly demanding tones, excessive noise levels, or persistent attempts to engage staff in inappropriate ways. Focus on the *action*, not the *person*, to maintain a professional and legally sound security posture.",
